This product includes GeoLite2 data created by MaxMind, available from
https://www.maxmind.com.

The mmdb provider (`OPP_GEOIP_PROVIDER=mmdb`) reads a GeoLite2 database
mounted at runtime via `OPP_GEOIP_MMDB`. The database itself is not
distributed in this repository; download it from MaxMind under your own
license (free for many uses, registration required) and honour their
attribution requirements when you publish derived data.
